<title>USA: IBM Corp raises qtly dividend to $0.40/shr. [Corrected 19:10 gmt]</title>
<headline>IBM Corp raises qtly dividend to $0.40/shr. [Corrected 19:10 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.40		     $0.35</p>
<p> Pay		   June 10</p>
<p> Record		  May 9</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is International Business Machines Corp.</p>
<p>The dividend is $0.20 a share after taking into account a 2-for-one stock split to be voted on at IBM's annual meeting today. (Clarifies status of proposed stock split).</p>
</text>
